{"id":"41a00088f1898c65","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-clone-composition.md","title":"Clone Composition","display":"Clone Composition","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-clone-composition","aliases":["93-lem-clone-composition"],"display":"Clone Composition","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-clone]]","[[93-df-composition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-clone-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-clone-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Clone Composition"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" href=\"?note=ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" title=\"93-df-clone\">93-df-clone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a57fde3586b9e79c\" href=\"?note=a57fde3586b9e79c\" title=\"93-df-composition\">93-df-composition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-clone-composition---Clone-Composition\">lem-clone-composition - Clone Composition</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)\">\\(f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf g\\in(C\\cap(A^m\\to A))^n\">\\(\\mathbf g\\in(C\\cap(A^m\\to A))^n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Super}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Super}_{93}\\)</span> is the explicit superposition constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" href=\"?note=ee2f4c926e0e30e6\" title=\"93-df-clone\">93-df-clone</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)\n\\land\\mathbf g\\in(C\\cap(A^m\\to A))^n\n\\to\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\\in C\\cap(A^m\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n,m\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)\n\\land\\mathbf g\\in(C\\cap(A^m\\to A))^n\n\\to\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\\in C\\cap(A^m\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Closure under composition is the operational core of the clone condition.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-clone-composition---Clone-Composition","text":"lem-clone-composition - Clone Composition","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-clone","status":"resolved","id":"ee2f4c926e0e30e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-clone]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"a57fde3586b9e79c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-clone","status":"resolved","id":"ee2f4c926e0e30e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Super}_{93}$ is the explicit superposition constructor of [[93-df-clone]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf g\\in(C\\cap(A^m\\to A))^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Super}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Clone}(C,A)\\land f\\in C\\cap(A^n\\to A)\n\\land\\mathbf g\\in(C\\cap(A^m\\to A))^n\n\\to\\operatorname{Super}_{93}(f,\\mathbf g;A,m,n)\\in C\\cap(A^m\\to A).","display":true}],"bytes":837,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["ee2f4c926e0e30e6","a57fde3586b9e79c"]}